classDiagram
 direction LR
 class Sku {
  +value: normalizedString
 }
 class Quantity {
  +value: nonNegativeInteger
 }
 class Money {
  +cents: safeInteger
  +currency: PEN
 }
 class Address {
  +value: validatedString
 }
 class InventoryItem {
  +id
  +sku: Sku
  +quantity: Quantity
  +price: Money
  +cost: Money
  +receive(amount)
  +issue(amount)
  +ensureSellable(amount)
 }
 class SaleSummary {
  +total: Money
 }
 class DispatchManifest {
  +id
  +destination: Address
  +status
  +transition(next)
 }
 InventoryItem *-- Sku
 InventoryItem *-- Quantity
 InventoryItem *-- Money
 SaleSummary *-- Money
 DispatchManifest *-- Address
 note for InventoryItem "Stable identity. Stock and conservation are independent."
 note for Money "Immutable. Primitive serialization belongs at adapter boundaries."
